          <span class="input-tip-btn" title="Search Tips:&#10;• Your own posts with the same tag will NOT be filtered.&#10;• Use 'AND' or 'OR' to refine (e.g. cat AND hat).&#10;• Plain words are loose: ear can match earth.&#10;• Put a word in quotes for exact token search: &quot;ear&quot; skips earth.&#10;• The same rule works in the Exclude box.&#10;• 'Load more' reveals more posts, but hidden ones may still take up page space.&#10;• Title, description, negative prompt, seed, and tag are not searchable." onclick="window.___showInputHint746291937(this)" style="font-size:13px; cursor:pointer; user-select:none; color:var(--text-color);"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:1.1em; vertical-align:-0.15em;">info</span></span>

          <button class="mobile-search-collapse" title="Hide exclude filter" onclick="document.getElementById('galleryExcludeGroup').classList.remove('expanded'); document.getElementById('mobileSearchToggleBtn').classList.remove('hidden');">
